OL,3,AHarry Potter play producer says cost of
OL,4,Aliving made two-part show 'impossible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Harry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,7,Fproducer has said the rising cost of
OL,8,Fliving made it "literally impossible"
OL,9,Fto retain the play's original format in
OL,10,Ftwo parts.
OL,12,FThe production has been cut down to a
OL,13,Fsingle three-hour show and is set to
OL,14,Fre-open in the West End next month.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
